Interaction audio
-----------------
The generated PCM bank (and macOS copy) contains four presets: three
adapt selected Kenney Interface Sounds and Impact Sounds samples (CC0):
https://kenney.nl/assets/interface-sounds
https://kenney.nl/assets/impact-sounds
The fourth, original synthesized chirp is project code/audio under MIT. The other
files are trimmed, level adjusted and faded; assets/audio/manifest.json records
each source, license, processing recipe and checksum. Original Kenney license
notices are retained beside the WAV files. See docs/interaction-audio.md.
These third-party sounds are separate from the project's CC BY 4.0 artwork.

The original DSH default duck pair (Ya1.mp3 / Ya2.mp3) is bundled byte-for-byte
from upstream commit 5247dd6813d6e4430728f39ccc63d43cda046022. This audio
is separate from the project MIT and artwork CC BY 4.0 licenses; no MIT or
CC0 grant is asserted. Upstream excludes assets/** from MIT, describes an
as-is scope for its own plugin and grants no relicensing. An independent
original source or redistribution license has not been verified. See
assets/audio/DSH-PROVENANCE.txt and docs/interaction-audio.md.

