Hugeicons free UI icons
----------------------
Toolbar controls and bubble-page editor icons are an unmodified
path-data subset of @hugeicons/core-free-icons 4.3.5 (Stroke Rounded), from
https://github.com/hugeicons/hugeicons . SVG markup is generated mechanically
from the official package data, not redrawn. These third-party icons use MIT,
not this project's CC BY 4.0 artwork grant. The complete original notice is in
licenses/hugeicons-LICENSE.txt and assets/ui/hugeicons/LICENSE.md; provenance
and per-file hashes are in assets/ui/hugeicons/source.json. No Pro or legacy
restricted static icon assets are included.

Motion Mini animation engine
----------------------------
The renderer bundles the original framer-motion 14.4.0 dist/dom-mini.js
browser distribution from https://github.com/motiondivision/motion .
The Motion repository's MIT license and version/hash provenance accompany it
in src/vendor/motion/. No Motion+ material or runtime CDN request is used.
The project adapter invokes the library's animate/stop interfaces; it does
not implement its own animation interpolation engine.

SortableJS page ordering
------------------------
The settings renderer bundles the original SortableJS 1.15.7 Sortable.min.js
browser distribution from https://github.com/SortableJS/Sortable .
Original upstream bytes, the complete MIT license and pinned provenance
are retained in src/vendor/sortable/. SortableJS provides pointer tracking,
card displacement animation and auto-scroll through its official options.
No runtime CDN request or custom reordering animation engine is used.
